{"id":"ac33b72c805f1644","group":"28","path":"28/28-lem-straight-line-degree-bound.md","title":"Straight-Line Degree Bound","display":"lem-straight-line-degree-bound — Straight-Line Degree Bound","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-lem-straight-line-degree-bound","aliases":["28-lem-straight-line-degree-bound"],"display":"lem-straight-line-degree-bound — Straight-Line Degree Bound","depends_on":["[[28-df-arithmetic-straight-line-program]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Lemma 16.4 and proof","source_printed_pages":"320","source_pdf_pages":"346","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-lem-straight-line-degree-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-lem-straight-line-degree-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-straight-line-degree-bound — Straight-Line Degree Bound"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"53c4f439c97d8ab1\" href=\"?note=53c4f439c97d8ab1\" title=\"28-df-arithmetic-straight-line-program\">28-df-arithmetic-straight-line-program</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Lemma 16.4 and proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"320"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"346"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F\">\\(\\mathbb F\\)</span> 为域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(T\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(c,P)\\in\\operatorname{SLP}_{\\mathbb F,n}(T)\">\\((c,P)\\in\\operatorname{SLP}_{\\mathbb F,n}(T)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y_i\">\\(y_i\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"53c4f439c97d8ab1\" href=\"?note=53c4f439c97d8ab1\" title=\"28-df-arithmetic-straight-line-program\">28-df-arithmetic-straight-line-program</a>；所有寄存器解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]\">\\(\\mathbb F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]\\)</span> 中元素；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg0=0\">\\(\\deg0=0\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in[T]\\quad\\deg y_i\\le2^i,\\qquad\\deg\\operatorname{SLPout}(c,P)\\le2^T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall i\\in[T]\\quad\\deg y_i\\le2^i,\\qquad\\deg\\operatorname{SLPout}(c,P)\\le2^T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>初始变量次数1、常量次数0。第i步先前次数均≤2<sup>{i−1}，相加取最大不增界，相乘次数至多两倍；归纳得2</sup>i。域中消去可能降低次数，只会改善上界。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 16.4 and proof；印刷页 320；PDF 页 346。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第16章的 Straight-Line Degree Bound，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-arithmetic-straight-line-program","status":"resolved","id":"53c4f439c97d8ab1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-arithmetic-straight-line-program]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-arithmetic-straight-line-program","status":"resolved","id":"53c4f439c97d8ab1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb F$ 为域，$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$T\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$(c,P)\\in\\operatorname{SLP}_{\\mathbb F,n}(T)$，$y_i$ 见 [[28-df-arithmetic-straight-line-program]]；所有寄存器解释为 $\\mathbb F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]$ 中元素；$\\deg0=0$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb F","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"T\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"(c,P)\\in\\operatorname{SLP}_{\\mathbb F,n}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"y_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\deg0=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall i\\in[T]\\quad\\deg y_i\\le2^i,\\qquad\\deg\\operatorname{SLPout}(c,P)\\le2^T.","display":true}],"bytes":1581,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-355","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-arithmetic-straight-line-program]]、[[28-lem-straight-line-degree-bound]]、[[28-df-arithmetic-formula]]、[[28-df-polynomial-projection]]、[[28-df-algebraic-computation-tree]]、[[28-thm-element-distinctness-components]]、[[28-df-bss-machine]]、[[28-df-complex-bss-p-np]]。"}],"outgoing":["53c4f439c97d8ab1"]}